@startuml
title A05 - App platform
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "A05\nApp platform" as A05
interface "ApiClient.request(); VersionedCache.put/get(); pushCapability(); classifyFetchFailure()" as API
database "Owned state\nVersioned local cache; browser subscription state" as State
queue "Input / output\nInjected fetch/token + command → JSON result/error; cached snapshot → explicit stale flag" as IO
API --> A05
IO --> A05
A05 --> State : owns
component "B01\nIdentity/access" as B01
A05 ..> B01 : contract / port
component "B07\nRead models/API" as B07
A05 ..> B07 : contract / port
component "B08\nOperations/data" as B08
A05 ..> B08 : contract / port
note bottom of A05
Flow: Attach bearer/idempotency headers; classify auth/service/network failures; retain only newer cache versions; expose exact push capability reason.
Guard: Cache never claims server commit. Push permission/subscription is not human acknowledgement.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
